194
00:23:00,930 --> 00:23:06,970
abstract, is to examine in more detail the problems facing small and medium -sized

195
00:23:06,970 --> 00:23:12,870
enterprises, which arise at least in part from having to adapt to rapid advances in

196
00:23:12,870 --> 00:23:18,390
