197
00:23:18,390 --> 00:23:22,410
point of view and to offer a few hopefully effective solutions.

198
00:23:23,490 --> 00:23:28,550
Here we have three of the most important problems facing small businesses that I

199
00:23:28,550 --> 00:23:29,850
want to look at today.

200
00:23:31,550 --> 00:23:37,170
keeping up with pace of technological change, recruiting high -quality staff in a

201
00:23:37,170 --> 00:23:43,510
time of skills shortages in IT as a whole, and in a highly competitive market, and

202
00:23:43,510 --> 00:23:47,270
the issue of retaining staff once they have been recruited and trained.

203
00:23:47,270 --> 00:23:53,970
Now, all of these problems involve significant costs for all businesses, but they

204
00:23:53,970 --> 00:23:58,710
are a particularly challenging issue for small and medium -sized enterprises.

205
00:24:00,090 --> 00:24:04,230
And those costs will vary depending on the size and scale of the businesses.

206
00:24:05,510 --> 00:24:10,110
So let's come to the first issue on our list, which is keeping pace with

207
00:24:10,110 --> 00:24:11,590
developments in technology.

208
00:24:12,970 --> 00:24:18,530
Now we all know that the technology industry is intensely competitive, with new

209
00:24:18,530 --> 00:24:23,170
products being launched all year round as the various companies strive to compete

210
00:24:23,170 --> 00:24:27,690
with each other, rather than, say, once a year or every couple of years.

211
00:24:28,050 --> 00:24:30,910
And this is a real headache for smaller businesses.

212
00:24:31,930 --> 00:24:36,170
So let's imagine we have a small company, which is doing okay.

213
00:24:36,470 --> 00:24:41,570
It's just about making a profit, and it spends most of its income on overheads.

214
00:24:42,150 --> 00:24:46,830
So for a company in this situation, keeping up to date with the latest technology,

215
00:24:47,790 --> 00:24:52,710
even if it's only for the benefit of key staff, this can be hugely expensive.

216
00:24:53,830 --> 00:24:58,990
So in my view, some creative thinking needs to come in here, to find ways to help

217
00:24:58,990 --> 00:25:04,470
companies in this situation to stay ahead in the game, but at the same time to

218
00:25:04,470 --> 00:25:06,530
remain technologically competitive.

